{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42170","headline":"送元帅书记高郎中出爲婺源建威军使 · 徐铉","name":"送元帅书记高郎中出爲婺源建威军使","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒风萧瑟楚江南，记室戎装挂锦帆。\n倚马未曾妨笑傲，斩牲先要厉威严。\n危言昔日尝无隐，壮节今来信不凡。\n惟有杯盘思上国，酒醪甜淡菜蔬甘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42170.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42170","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}